OK   finite field: the fixture solves without the option (the existing suite's expectation)
OK   finite field: Deadline -> Infinity solves the fixture the same way
OK   finite field: Deadline -> Infinity changes no payload key
OK   finite field: Deadline -> Infinity changes no result key set
     finite field baseline / Deadline -> Infinity seconds: Short[{4.74, 6.97}, 4]
OK   finite field: an expired deadline returns Status BudgetExhausted
OK   finite field: the stop is typed, never $Aborted and never $Failed
OK   finite field: the stop names a stage from the declared vocabulary
OK   finite field: the stop returns in under 30 s of wall time
OK   finite field: the stop carries the partial-progress identifiers
OK   finite field: the reported progress counters are well formed
     finite field expiry: Short[<|Stage -> Entry, Elapsed -> 0.046383`5.117903828382467, Prime -> None, PrimesCompleted -> 0, SamplesDone -> 0, SupportSize -> Missing[NotProbed], ProbeCount -> 0, SupportLearningPass -> False|>, 4]
